---
title: "limiter::add_outflow (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_count: curr_outflow = count_current_outflow(now)
    q_count --> q_check_limit: curr_outflow + value <= outflow_limit?
    q_check_limit --> q_error_limit: exceeds limit
    q_check_limit --> q_calc_index: within limit
    q_error_limit --> [*]: abort outflow_reach_limit_error
    q_calc_index --> q_check_segment: timestamp_index = now / segment_duration
    q_check_segment --> q_reset_segment: segment.index != timestamp_index
    q_check_segment --> q_add_value: segment.index == timestamp_index
    q_reset_segment --> q_add_value: segment.index = timestamp_index, segment.value = 0
    q_add_value --> [*]: segment.value += value

    note right of q_count
        INV-001: outflow summed across all segments in cycle window
        INV-002: stale segments (outside cycle) excluded from sum
        INV-003: segment automatically reset when timestamp_index changes
        INV-004: total outflow per cycle <= outflow_limit
    end note
